                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Received from J. R. Tinsly. esq., forty pounds sterling to enable me to pay my
                    necessary expenses in reaching my home in the United States.</p>
                <p>£40.</p>
